{
  "facts": [
    {
      "topic": "scope",
      "statement": "The entry compresses input with ZSTD_compressStream2, then decompresses the result and checks its size and bytes against the original input.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":156,"end_line":190,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ]
    ,
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "The supplied build script delegates fuzzer compilation to tests/fuzz/fuzz.py; the displayed script does not itself establish the effective compressor exclusion flags.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6","start_line":19,"end_line":24,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "trigger",
      "statement": "The parameter helper draws a strategy from ZSTD_STRATEGY_MIN through ZSTD_STRATEGY_MAX and passes it through ZSTD_adjustCParams. The entry installs the resulting strategy on its compression context.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":44,"end_line":56,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":101,"end_line":110,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"FUZZ_setRandomParameters installs the adjusted strategy."},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":59,"end_line":67,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The entry calls that helper before streaming compression."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "In the changed source, ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal conditionally cascades an excluded selected strategy toward a lower strategy, ending at ZSTD_fast when the DFAST compressor is excluded.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":1470,"end_line":1510,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "target_route",
      "statement": "Streaming initialization derives compression parameters from the requested context parameters, and that derivation calls ZSTD_adjustCParams_internal before compression proceeds.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":6175,"end_line":6208,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":1624,"end_line":1637,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"ZSTD_getCParamsFromCCtxParams invokes the adjustment function."},
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":6285,"end_line":6308,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"ZSTD_compressStream2 invokes streaming initialization when its context is in the init stage."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "contract",
      "statement": "The changed selector uses compressor macros in its strategy tables, selects a row or ordinary table entry, and asserts that the selected compressor is nonnull. The sequence-store path calls that selector when using the internal parser or falling back to it.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":3032,"end_line":3115,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":3330,"end_line":3355,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"These branches show calls from sequence-store construction to compressor selection."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The helper's initial ZSTD_adjustCParams call and streaming initialization's later adjustment are two existing routes that can apply the changed strategy fallback; the supplied evidence does not establish that either is bypassed for an excluded strategy.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-194debf8ea4cd55b47ba","start_line":44,"end_line":56,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":1598,"end_line":1606,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"ZSTD_adjustCParams delegates to the changed internal adjustment."},
        {"unit_id":"u-b5697ee0104bd691ea91","start_line":6194,"end_line":6201,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"Streaming initialization derives adjusted parameters again."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "configuration",
      "statement": "The displayed new libzstd.mk variable defaults for DFAST-and-up and GREEDY-and-up compressor exclusions are both zero. Their applicability to this target depends on the delegated build path.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-fe22d2cdbb2a3c4846ec","start_line":1,"end_line":2,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-043cf5aa9ced10a35cb6","start_line":19,"end_line":24,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"The supplied build script delegates compilation to fuzz.py."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "counterevidence",
      "statement": "The displayed old dispatch entries are direct compressor function names for the strategy variants; the displayed changed entries use compressor macros. That replacement alone does not show a failing selected entry.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-88c982336dcb669838b7","start_line":1,"end_line":27,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9f4d3beb8172ba78523b","start_line":1,"end_line":30,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    },
    {
      "topic": "consequence",
      "statement": "An error from a streaming compression call violates an existing FUZZ_ZASSERT. The entry also checks successful decompression and equality with the original input.",
      "evidence": [
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":81,"end_line":115,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
        {"unit_id":"u-9dc9e88ae722c8cbe085","start_line":124,"end_line":135,"role":"primary","dependency_reason":""},
