        {"unit_id":"u-a7cd9e43defd8d40468a","start_line":40,"end_line":47,"role":"dependency","dependency_reason":"These macros abort on a failed assertion or a zstd error."}
      ],
      "absence_claim": false,
      "audited_unit_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "missing_information": [
    "The effective stream_round_trip build path and flags: whether tests/fuzz/fuzz.py and tests/fuzz/Makefile use lib/libzstd.mk and enable compressor exclusion variables.",
